0,Subanen languages - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Subanen_languages,The Subanen languages (also Subanon and Subanun) are a group of closely related Austronesian languages belonging to the Greater Central Philippine subgroup.,"Subanon, Western",Austronesian
