2,"Subanon, Western Language (SUC)... | Ethnologue Free",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/suc/,Western Subanon is an endangered indigenous language of the Philippines. It belongs to the Austronesian language family.,"Subanon, Western",Austronesian
3,Western Subanon - suc (Austronesian) - PeopleGroups.org,https://peoplegroups.org/language/suc/,"Western Subanon (suc) is part of the Austronesian family and Austronesian, Malayo-Polynesian, Greater Central Philippine, Subanon class. Western Subanon speaking People Groups across the world: Fast Facts","Subanon, Western",Austronesian
4,Subanonphonology.pdf,https://zorc.net/RDZorc/SUBANEN/Subanon_Phonology_Bryn_Hauk.pdf,"The consonant phonemes of Western Subanon are presented in Table 3. Vowel phonemes are given in Table 4. A list of allophones of each phoneme, with examples, appears in Table 5. Minimal and near minimal pairs for some contrasts are given in the appendix.","Subanon, Western",Austronesian
