6,WORKING PAPERS,http://ling.hawaii.edu/wp-content/uploads/Working-Paper-in-Linguistics-Vol-51-Blake.pdf,"This paper explores hesitation phenomena in one western Austronesian language, Western Subanon (ISO639-3: suc), and shows that speakers use a number of additional delay devices besides segmental lengthening.","Subanon, Western",Austronesian
